##  Generated dedicated ed25519 keypair for the jump host lab and authorized it

> **Timestamp:** `2026-07-07 11:55:10`

### 01. `ssh-keygen -t ed25519 -f ~/.ssh/id_ed25519_jumplab -N '' -q`

```bash
ssh-keygen -t ed25519 -f ~/.ssh/id_ed25519_jumplab -N '' -q
```

**Output:**

```text
/home/dell_xps/.ssh/id_ed25519_jumplab already exists.
Overwrite (y/n)? ```

### 02. `cat ~/.ssh/id_ed25519_jumplab.pub >> ~/.ssh/authorized_keys`

```bash
cat ~/.ssh/id_ed25519_jumplab.pub >> ~/.ssh/authorized_keys
```

**Output:**

```text
```

### 03. `echo 'Key generated and authorized'`

