##  Captured verbose SSH trace showing the two-hop authentication through the bastion

> **Timestamp:** `2026-07-07 11:57:07`

### 01. `ssh -v -o StrictHostKeyChecking=no -o BatchMode=yes private-server 'echo done' 2>&1 | grep -E 'proxy command|Authenticating|forwarded'`

```bash
ssh -v -o StrictHostKeyChecking=no -o BatchMode=yes private-server 'echo done' 2>&1 | grep -E 'proxy command|Authenticating|forwarded'
```

**Output:**

```text
debug1: Executing proxy command: exec ssh -v -W '[127.0.0.1]:2222' bastion
debug1: Authenticating to 127.0.0.1:22 as 'dell_xps'
debug1: Authenticating to 127.0.0.1:2222 as 'dell_xps'
